# Project Rules

## Project Shape
- This project is configured for SwarmForge with one persistent Codex-backed squad leader agent.
- Transient agents are planned but not implemented in the first slice.
- Project language: Babashka.

## Local Configuration
- Preserve project-local SwarmForge configuration under `swarmforge/`.
- Keep swarm state local under `.swarmforge/`, worktrees under `.worktrees/`, and shared scripts under `swarmforge/scripts/`.

## Handoffs
- Prefer terse, explicit handoffs that report state and request role-appropriate review.
- Do not include verification logs or sender process narrative in handoffs.

## Ownership
- Do not change squad workflow ownership, role templates, or branch-local constitution articles without explicit user direction.
